# Treat all files under docs/ as documentation so GitHub Linguist does not count HTML/JS toward the repo language stats
docs/** linguist-documentation
# These files are 100% CRLF in the repo. Mark them binary-ish (`-text`) so git
# stores them verbatim and core.autocrlf cannot normalize them to LF on add
# (which would show the whole file as changed in the diff).
CHANGELOG.md -text
assets/how-it-works-en.svg -text
src/mcptoon/serve.py -text
